---
Title: Zuppa Toscana Soup
Tags: Nom Nom Central, Pork, Soup
---

Set oven to 300F.

Put then sliced @Italian Sausage{1lb} on a #baking sheet{} and roast for 30 minutes or until cooked.

Place diced @Potatoes{1 lb}, @Onions{1 cup}, @Chicken Broth{29 oz}, @Water{1 quart}, mminced @Garlic{2 Cloves} in a #large pot{} on medium heat until cooked.

Add Sausage, @Bacon{1/4 cup}, @Salt, @Black Pepper{} and simmer for another 10 minutes.

Turn the heat to low, add @Kale{2 cups} and @Heavy Cream{1 cup}.

Heat thoroughly and serve.  